## 1. Fohlmeister-Miller channel mechanisms (NEURON `.mod`)

**Files:** `engine/cable/mechanisms/spike.mod`, `engine/cable/mechanisms/capump.mod`

**Origin:** ModelDB accession #3673 (<https://modeldb.science/3673>). Implemented for
NEURON by T. J. Velte (1995), after Fohlmeister et al. (1990); see Fohlmeister and
Miller (1997).

**Terms:** No explicit license accompanies the ModelDB entry. ModelDB publishes code
for research reuse, but with no stated terms the redistribution rights are undefined.
These files are therefore **excluded from this project's MIT grant**. They are included
here for research use, with attribution, on the same unstated terms as the original.

**Modification:** `capump.mod` is verbatim. `spike.mod` carries one documented change,
q10 temperature scaling for mammalian (37 degrees C) behaviour, which makes it a
derivative work. The change is recorded in full in
`engine/cable/mechanisms/PROVENANCE.md`, including the verification that the model
reduces exactly to the original at the reference temperature.

**Please cite:** Fohlmeister JF and Miller RF (1997), and ModelDB #3673.

